{title: Open Road}
{artist: Guitar Chords Demo}
{language: English}
{key: D}
{capo: 0}
{difficulty: beginner}
{strumming: D DU UDU}
{rights: original}
{rights_notes: Original demonstration lyrics and chord progression.}

{start_of_verse}
[D]Walking down an [A]open road
[Bm]Leaving behind a [G]heavy load
[D]Every mile and [A]every bend
[G]Brings another [D]place to begin
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]Let the wind [A]carry me
[Bm]Past the hills and [G]through the trees
[D]Every step is [A]something new
[G]Underneath a [D]sky of blue
{end_of_chorus}